🚀 FastAPI + LangChain + Groq Translation API

A simple production-ready API server built using FastAPI, LangChain, and Groq (LLaMA 3.1) that translates text into a specified language.

This project demonstrates:

LangChain runnable interfaces

Prompt templates

Output parsing

LangServe route integration

Environment-based API key management

📌 Features

🌍 Translate text into any language

⚡ FastAPI backend

🔗 LangChain runnable pipeline

🤖 Groq LLaMA-3.1-8b model

🧩 LangServe automatic route exposure

🔐 Secure API key loading using .env

🏗️ Architecture
User Request
      ↓
FastAPI Endpoint (/chain)
      ↓
LangChain Prompt Template
      ↓
Groq LLM (LLaMA 3.1 8B)
      ↓
Output Parser
      ↓
JSON Response
